WEBVTT

NOTE Silent video. Cues are the on-screen step captions; the terminal text is in the transcript.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.133
Maintainer data on the page: owner, stakeholders and review-interval ship with the page. The schema marks them external.

2
00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:16.700
validate: warn, don't fail: validate flags each misplaced value as location:external. Exit 0, so CI never blocks.

3
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:25.133
relocate moves them: relocate creates site.metadata.yaml and moves the three values into it, keyed by page.

4
00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:31.500
The page slims down: The page drops three lines. manni.config.yaml now says the manifest owns those keys.

5
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:38.167
validate: clean: Same values, now in the manifest. validate is clean: no warnings, exit 0.

